    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "The applicant is the mother-in-law of the deceased victim.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 634,
      "end": 693,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.37160971760749817
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The applicant is in custody since 09.08.2022.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 694,
      "end": 739,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "09.08.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 728,
          "end": 738
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.29293447732925415
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "It is stated by Mr. Khatri, learned counsel for the applicant that the CCTV footage would show that the applicant was not present at the time of incident.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 740,
      "end": 895,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Khatri",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 761,
          "end": 767
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14976665377616882
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "In addition, the GD entry would also show that the complainant had already made a GD entry prior to the date of incident where she has not made any allegations regarding dowry.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 896,
      "end": 1073,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.31503987312316895
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Issue notice.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1074,
      "end": 1088,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07595968246459961
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Mr. Utkarsh, learned APP accepts notice, seeks and is granted 4 weeks to file a response/ status report.",
